    native_spec_core_c_bootstrap_bundle_lacks_rt_bdd_symbols_2026-11-12, 0, "2026-11-12 OPEN. A spec compiled on the native route (--native-backend=cranelift, Stage 2 producer, core-c-bootstrap runtime bundle) fails at link: undefined rt_bdd_record_result / rt_bdd_executed_total / rt_bdd_failed_total referenced from lib.nogc_sync_mut.spec.print_summary; the symbols live in src/runtime/runtime.c but not in the bundle. Link also runs through cc (collect2). Evidence: doc/08_tracking/bug/native_spec_core_c_bootstrap_bundle_lacks_rt_bdd_symbols_2026-11-12.md."

